   {
    "en": "Point Survivor: Redeem Your Points as Combat Power"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "In a modern world where reward systems are unified under the “R.A.I.D Points” network, Sohta Asahi lives a simple life devoted to collecting points, dreaming of becoming a “point nomad” who survives solely on what he earns.\n\nEverything changes when mysterious “gates” appear worldwide, unleashing monstrous creatures that devastate cities and threaten humanity. During a deadly attack, Sohta hears a voice from the heavens:\n\n”R.A.I.D Points Expansion Protocol Activated. Points can now be converted into combat power.”\n\nWith his meticulously saved points, Sohta gains extraordinary abilities, allowing him to face both the monsters and other “Survivors” who wield the same power. Teaming up with his sentient point card, Ivy, he embarks on an action-packed journey to uncover the secrets of the gates and save the world.\n\nA thrilling tale where points become power, and survival belongs to the strongest!\nLess..."
  },
